<p>Join us for an immersive afternoon at our Le Marais location, featuring a gourmet coffee and pastry pairing, hosted by an expert barista.</p><p>Discover a variety of coffee blends from renowned regions like Ethiopia, Colombia, and Sumatra, understanding how each origin influences the flavor.</p><ul><li>Learn the art of coffee tasting. </li><li>Enjoy a selection of handcrafted pastries and light bites that complement your coffee, in a cozy café setting in the heart of Paris. <br/></li><li>Try different coffee styles, including espresso, latte, and cold brew from places like Sumatra, Colombia, and Ethiopia. <br/></li><li>Indulge in freshly baked pastries and delicious snacks <br/></li><li>Gain insights into brewing techniques and coffee-tasting methods from your experienced barista guide. </li><li>Relax and enjoy the unique flavors and aromas of each coffee blend.</li></ul>
</div>
