<p>Join us for our innovative Urban Gardening Workshop in the vibrant district of Nørrebro, where expert gardener Anne Hansen will guide you through the essentials of growing your own herbs and vegetables in an urban setting. </p><p></p><p>Learn to cultivate plants like tomatoes, basil, and peppers right in your apartment or balcony, and discover organic and sustainable gardening practices. </p><p></p><ul><li>Explore the basics of container gardening and vertical planting. <br/></li><li>Get hands-on experience with starting your own urban garden, using easily available materials and space-efficient techniques. <br/></li><li>Understand how to care for your plants and maximize your yield in a small space. <br/></li><li>Learn about composting and natural pest control to maintain a healthy garden. <br/></li><li>Whether you're new to gardening or looking to expand your green thumb in the city, this workshop will provide you with the knowledge and skills to create a thriving urban garden.</li></ul>
</div>
