<p>This year’s competition will unfold as follows: </p><p></p><p>Participants will <span style="text-decoration:underline">bake their apple pies </span>at home and bring them to the event site on <strong>Saturday, November 9th, </strong><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>no </strong></span><strong>later than 12:00pm</strong>.</p><p></p><p>The pies will be displayed in a designated area, and the judging will occur on Saturday, November 9th at 3:00pm. The top three pies will be showcased, and the winners will be announced during the event. </p><p></p><p>Each participant must bring their own pie, freshly baked, showcasing their best recipe. The competition focuses on flavor, presentation, and originality. It's a wonderful opportunity for baking enthusiasts to showcase their skills and for the community to come together and celebrate a beloved American tradition.</p>
